---
layout: base.njk
title: Your studio is ready
noindex: true
# One page per language (#114) — see src/index.njk for the reasoning.
pagination:
  data: languages
  size: 1
  alias: language
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "{{ language.prefix }}/checkout/done/"
description: "Your Prospektor workspace is live. Sign in with the address you paid with; the brief is drafted and the first prospects are already being researched."
---

{# Stripe Checkout's success_url (#244): celebrate, then confirm. What was
   bought, what actually left the card (fetched live from the session —
   promo codes make the first invoice anything from $0.01 up, and this page
   must never invent a number), the address the studio is tied to, and that
   the receipt is Stripe's mail, already on its way. One action: sign in.
   Without a session_id (old bookmark, resubscribe path, fetch failure) the
   card keeps its generic lines and nothing here breaks. #}
<section class="onboard">
  <div class="onboard-inner">

    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step done"><span class="step-n-badge">✓</span>{% t %}Scan{% endt %}</li>
      <li class="step done"><span class="step-n-badge">✓</span>{% t %}Your target{% endt %}</li>
      <li class="step done"><span class="step-n-badge">✓</span>{% t %}Payment{% endt %}</li>
      <li class="step active"><span class="step-n-badge">4</span>{% t %}Sign in{% endt %}</li>
    </ol>

    <div class="onboard-panel">
      <h1 class="onboard-h1">{% t %}You're in.{% endt %} <span class="done-check">✓</span></h1>
      <p class="onboard-sub">{% t %}Payment confirmed — your studio is already reading your site and drafting your brief.{% endt %}</p>

      <div class="order-card" id="confirmCard">
        <div class="order-row">
          <span class="order-name">{% t %}Prospektor · one workspace{% endt %}</span>
          <span class="order-price">$999<span class="order-per">/mo</span></span>
        </div>
        <ul class="confirm-list">
          <li id="confirmPaid" hidden>{% t %}Paid today:{% endt %} <strong id="confirmAmount"></strong></li>
          <li id="confirmEmail" hidden>{% t %}Your sign-in:{% endt %} <strong id="confirmAddress"></strong></li>
          <li>{% t %}Your receipt is on its way — Stripe emails it to the address you paid with{% endt %}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="onboard-actions">
        <a class="btn-cta" href="https://studio.prospektor.ai">{% t %}Sign in to your studio →{% endt %}</a>
      </div>
      <p class="onboard-sub">{% t %}Sign in with Google using that address — or have the studio email you a single-use link. No token, no setup wizard.{% endt %}</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/checkout-done.js' | asset }}" defer></script>
